<Legal title="Cancellation & Refunds" description="Cancellation and refund policy for Krylabs paid digital products and subscriptions.">

  <p>This policy applies to paid digital products and subscriptions offered by Krylabs, owned and operated by Krithick Santhosh.</p>

  <h2>Subscriptions purchased via the App Store</h2>
  <p>Subscriptions and in-app purchases made through Apple's App Store are managed by Apple. Cancellations and refunds for those purchases are handled under Apple's terms, through your Apple account settings.</p>

  <h2>Direct purchases</h2>
  <p>For purchases made directly through Krylabs, you may request cancellation by contacting us. Approved refunds are processed to the original payment method within <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</p>

  <h2>How to request</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:info.krylabs@gmail.com">info.krylabs@gmail.com</a> with your order details. We review each request and respond promptly.</p>
</Legal>
